WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Vehicle rules depend on activity and jurisdiction. Identify the relevant authority and current official source before making a compliance claim.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Separate classroom calculation, engineering verification and legal certification; they are not interchangeable.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Source-path exercise

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

